          "author": "Ladybird",
          "description": "A collection of original audio stories, counting down the days to Christmas! These new stories are especially written for the festive period, excellent listening for when you're decorating the tree, wrapping presents or making the Christmas pudding! \n\nThis edition is filled with creative and engaging sound effects and is the perfect way to get little listeners excited for Santa's arrival! \n\nThis audiobook is aimed at children aged four and above, for family listening and learning and development for young minds.",
